    {
      "id": "F29vRuQVnaXbvt8DwgExx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -69,
      "y": 403,
      "width": 414.3597106933594,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1r4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 740685344,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1010971168,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794252943992,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "answer"
      },
      "text": "Sure. Four moves, one at a time:\n1 Divide: split it, name the parts\n2 Compare: what's alike, what's opposite\n3 Infer: find the rule or the cause\n4 Transform: make it concrete or abstract\nGray boxes on the right are optional.\n\nStart with Divide. The word to split is\n\"alert\". Last night you had:\n- disk at 81%\n- queue depth blips\n- payment sync retry warnings\n- cert expiry reminder\n- #287, queue depth > 500 on pdf-render\n\nFor each one: what was it asking you\nto do at 2am? Your words are fine,\neven \"nothing\". Write them here and Send.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Sure. Four moves, one at a time:\n1 Divide: split it, name the parts\n2 Compare: what's alike, what's opposite\n3 Infer: find the rule or the cause\n4 Transform: make it concrete or abstract\nGray boxes on the right are optional.\n\nStart with Divide. The word to split is\n\"alert\". Last night you had:\n- disk at 81%\n- queue depth blips\n- payment sync retry warnings\n- cert expiry reminder\n- #287, queue depth > 500 on pdf-render\n\nFor each one: what was it asking you\nto do at 2am? Your words are fine,\neven \"nothing\". Write them here and Send.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "GDbosZSUBcJzwq3iE2C9H",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -68.82014465332031,
      "y": 884,
      "width": 501.01971435546875,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1r5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1970728480,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1604783072,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794252957707,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "disk 81%: nothing. maybe look next week\nqueue blips: nothing, they drain\npayment retries: nothing, unless retries run out\ncert: nothing at 2am. renew it sometime this month\n#287: get up and fix it NOW.\nbut it didnt say that. read same as the blips",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "disk 81%: nothing. maybe look next week\nqueue blips: nothing, they drain\npayment retries: nothing, unless retries run out\ncert: nothing at 2am. renew it sometime this month\n#287: get up and fix it NOW.\nbut it didnt say that. read same as the blips",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
