      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794253005074,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3 kinds i guess\nwake me: 287\nchore for daytime: disk, cert\nweather: queue blips. happens, goes away\nretries are weather UNTIL they run out, then wake me.\nso its not really one alert? its 2 things in 1 name\nsame w the queue honestly",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
