      "text": "wake me: 287\nchore for daytime: disk, cert\nweather: queue blips. happens, goes away\n\nretries are weather UNTIL they run out, then wake me.\nso its not really one alert? its 2 things in 1 name\nsame w the queue honestly",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "wake me: 287\nchore for daytime: disk, cert\nweather: queue blips. happens, goes away\n\nretries are weather UNTIL they run out, then wake me.\nso its not really one alert? its 2 things in 1 name\nsame w the queue honestly",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "SbPimJchFYuyhJwrQ2pyT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -410,
      "y": 1588,
      "width": 404.45977783203125,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
