    {
      "id": "DIqkCUSoIUtFRfQqNu-ts",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -750,
      "y": 2968,
      "width": 401.3998107910156,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1rL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 38729696,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1902443488,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794253160525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "answer"
      },
      "text": "Bees do have that. In cold places the\nqueen stops or nearly stops laying in\nwinter. No eggs, nothing wrong. Keepers\ndon't open the hive then. They lift it\nto feel the weight, or listen for the hum.\n\nSo \"no eggs\" alone proves nothing.\nYou've just found the Contrast move.\nTwo cases with no eggs:\n  3am Sunday: nothing wrong\n  the night of #287: wake me\n\nWhat's different between those two?\n\n\"Who deletes alerts\" stays open on the\nright. We go there next.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Bees do have that. In cold places the\nqueen stops or nearly stops laying in\nwinter. No eggs, nothing wrong. Keepers\ndon't open the hive then. They lift it\nto feel the weight, or listen for the hum.\n\nSo \"no eggs\" alone proves nothing.\nYou've just found the Contrast move.\nTwo cases with no eggs:\n  3am Sunday: nothing wrong\n  the night of #287: wake me\n\nWhat's different between those two?\n\n\"Who deletes alerts\" stays open on the\nright. We go there next.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "KzKY2Y8aK2OFywmTjJnyn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -750.3000946044922,
      "y": 3398,
      "width": 552.839599609375,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
