      "versionNonce": 1224122912,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794253347371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "huh. no, deploy breaks and its not really my name\nsomeone reviewed it, tests passed, we roll back in 5 min\npostmortem blames the process\nalert delete: no review, no rollback, its just me in a UI\nand it blows up 3 months later when nobody remembers why\nso.. we delete alerts w/o the stuff that makes deploys safe?\nalerts in the repo, PR to remove, run it silent a few wks?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "huh. no, deploy breaks and its not really my name\nsomeone reviewed it, tests passed, we roll back in 5 min\npostmortem blames the process\nalert delete: no review, no rollback, its just me in a UI\nand it blows up 3 months later when nobody remembers why\nso.. we delete alerts w/o the stuff that makes deploys safe?\nalerts in the repo, PR to remove, run it silent a few wks?",
