      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1620732448,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794253380177,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "answer"
      },
      "text": "That's Lv4 Concrete, and it's your design.\nYour words are copied to the left.\n\nLined up, in your words:\n  someone reviewed it -> PR to remove\n  tests passed -> run it silent a few wks\n  roll back in 5 min -> alerts in the repo\n  postmortem blames the process -> ?\n\nNow Deduction: run June through it.\nThe disk alert for that box class goes\nsilent a few weeks. Nothing happens.\nThe PR merges. Then in June the db\nreplica fills up.\n\nWhose name is on it now?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "That's Lv4 Concrete, and it's your design.\nYour words are copied to the left.\n\nLined up, in your words:\n  someone reviewed it -> PR to remove\n  tests passed -> run it silent a few wks\n  roll back in 5 min -> alerts in the repo\n  postmortem blames the process -> ?\n\nNow Deduction: run June through it.\nThe disk alert for that box class goes\nsilent a few weeks. Nothing happens.\nThe PR merges. Then in June the db\nreplica fills up.\n\nWhose name is on it now?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7G88l1eOiiB7gwpyC8BQh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2650.369842529297,
      "y": 2467.5,
      "width": 560.0596923828125,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
