      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794253402494,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "the PR's i guess. me + reviewer + whoever ok'd the policy\nso not just mine. id actually delete things like that\nbut silent wks wouldnt catch that disk, it fills like\nonce a yr. so the review has to ask 'what catches this\nif its gone'. thats the hum again?\nok im fried. taking 2 things to the team thurs:\n1 in>0 out=0 page for pdf. 2 alerts in repo, PR to delete\nthanks. the bees are going in the retro doc",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "the PR's i guess. me + reviewer + whoever ok'd the policy\nso not just mine. id actually delete things like that\nbut silent wks wouldnt catch that disk, it fills like\nonce a yr. so the review has to ask 'what catches this\nif its gone'. thats the hum again?\nok im fried. taking 2 things to the team thurs:\n1 in>0 out=0 page for pdf. 2 alerts in repo, PR to delete\nthanks. the bees are going in the retro doc",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
