      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "claudeItem"
      },
      "text": "1  Page when PDF jobs go in (in > 0) and\n    none come out (out = 0) for a while.\n2  Keep alerts in the repo. Delete by PR.\n    The review asks: what catches this if it's gone?\n    On it: me + reviewer + whoever ok'd the policy.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1  Page when PDF jobs go in (in > 0) and\n    none come out (out = 0) for a while.\n2  Keep alerts in the repo. Delete by PR.\n    The review asks: what catches this if it's gone?\n    On it: me + reviewer + whoever ok'd the policy.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "WarwNzt3MKzvri535BcYy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2650,
      "y": 2700,
      "width": 414.89971923828125,
      "height": 475,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
